Option B) here won't work. Vampires are undead; so destroying a
vampire will give you a human corpse, and raising taming it would give
you a pet human (except that humans are untameable). NetHack doesn't
have a wand or spell that reanimates a corpse as undead...

As for the OP's question, you could also try luring the vampire into
combat with a nymph and hoping she steals the boots from it, then
getting them back from her corpse.

